        // distinct pin on the `ENTRADA_KEY_*` tetrad (a3d6162), the
        // two-way distinct pin on the `MEMBRO_KEY_*` pair (ce80ca0),
        // and the six-way distinct pin on the `CONTRATO_KEY_*` triad +
        // `WitTarget::*_FIELD_NAME` triad (ca463a4).
